{{!-- What sits under the sign-in card.

The design draws a Privacy · Terms line here and links neither — they are inert in the reference
build because the demo publication has no policy pages. A theme has no field for them either, and
a link to a page that does not exist is worse than no link, so the line is not carried. The Ship
ticket's rule about inert placeholders applies here first. Recorded in DECISIONS.md.

The route to sign-up is the publication's own signup page where one exists; where it does not,
Portal's is the only address there is, and `@site.signup_url` is the value Ghost computes for
exactly that question — it becomes a feed-reader URL when signups are closed, which is why no
template in this theme spells `#/portal/signup` by hand. --}}
{{#unless @site.members_invite_only}}
	<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-6 text-center text-sm">
		{{~t "Not a member yet?"}}
		<a
			href="{{@site.signup_url}}"
			class="text-accent underline">{{t "Sign up free"}}</a>
	</p>
{{/unless}}
